DESCRIPTION:This event has been cancelled. Both of the refreshment venues 
 have gone out of business since this summer when the event was planned. Jo
 in us for a leisurely Saturday morning ride along the Waterfront Trail as 
 we set off from Stonehooker Brewery in Port Credit in Mississauga to Sunny
 side Park Café for coffee\, then make our way back to Stonehooker Brewery
  via Mississauga’s newest conservation area – ‘Jim Tovey Park’. Th
 is is a new 26 hectare waterfront park at the shore of Lake Ontario. Here 
 we will discover the beauty of nature at this restored stretch of the shor
 eline with revitalized habitats and a network of trails\, pedestrian bridg
 es and a cycling trail beside the future site of Lakeview...
